\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, thy word abideth,
\par And our footsteps guideth,
\par Who its truth believeth
\par Light and joy receiveth.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When our foes are near us,
\par Then thy word doth cheer us,
\par Word of consolation,
\par Message of salvation.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When the storms are o'er us,
\par And dark clouds before us,
\par Then its light directeth
\par And our way protecteth.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Who can tell the pleasure,
\par Who recount the treasure,
\par By thy word imparted
\par To the simple-hearted?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Word of mercy, giving
\par Succour to the living;
\par Word of life, supplying
\par Comfort to the dying!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. O that we, discerning
\par Its most holy learning,
\par Lord, may love and fear Thee,
\par Evermore be near Thee! 
\par                              Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

